{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n「香港網球一哥」黃澤林月初宣告與前女友康堤結束半年戀愛關係，本月25日即被拍攝到與「籃球一姐」譚旻萱於廣州球場旁親密相擁。這段相隔時間極短新關係不僅引發網民質疑無縫接軌，更有排球員發文暗示自己慘遭背叛。錯綜複雜多角關係時間線隨著網民翻查社交平台互動逐一曝光。\n</p>\n<h2>網民翻查點讚紀錄揭露康堤情傷跡象</h2>\n<p>網民仔細翻查眾人Instagram點讚紀錄，發現譚旻萱曾於10月15日對康堤慶祝22歲巴黎生日帖文按下讚好，相隔大約10天後即被發現與黃澤林同遊廣州。追溯至9月13日，康堤最後一次對譚旻萱公布搬遷新居帖文讚好，其後雙方再無交集。康堤與黃澤林於9月上旬仍與朋友一同光顧壽司店，直到9月中旬後二人互相取消追蹤，當時已流傳分手消息。早前康堤現身公開場合時面容憔悴，身上散發著難以掩飾情傷。<br/>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316017398914362_3984422726ae173ee4fc87.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"vM-vFZeflNcxNb34QhxiFWc4dTDy0UydCffUUQn31FE.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316017398914362_3984422726ae173ee4fc87.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy曾讚好康堤於10月15日分享在巴黎度過22歲生日的帖文。（圖片來源：(ig@_constancec_)）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294195919821449_1318604176ade1f87bf835.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-25 下午11.04.42.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294195919821449_1318604176ade1f87bf835.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民翻查社交平台互動紀錄，指黃澤林早於9月10日便開始點讚女方帖文。（圖片來源：IG圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179202784274867715_178321706ad02cc321974.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 康堤上月被發現只有follow粉絲開設的專頁，而沒有黃澤林個人IG賬號。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179202784274867715_178321706ad02cc321974.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>康堤上月被發現只有follow粉絲開設的專頁，而沒有黃澤林個人IG賬號。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>譚旻萱社交帳號遭洗版引發兩極評價</h2>\n<p>緋聞傳出後，譚旻萱社交帳號瞬間湧入大批網民留言洗版。部分人士抨擊她疑似插足他人感情，並留言狠批其行為；另一派網民則發聲支持黃澤林迎接新戀情。儘管網上點讚紀錄、街頭照片及各方言論均無法確切證實當中有否存在第三者或「無縫換畫」情況，惟此次事件已於網絡世界觸發激烈陣營對立。</p>\n<h2>譚旻萱現身廣州與黃澤林親密互攬</h2>\n<p>有民眾於本月25日目擊譚旻萱現身廣州，與黃澤林結伴吃早餐及觀賞賽事。二人在球場旁邊舉止親暱，更被捕捉到相擁畫面，讓新戀情浮出水面。基於黃澤林於本月初剛坦承結束為期半年戀愛關係，這段時間差極短新發展隨即惹來各界注視。群眾比對二人近期行蹤，紛紛質疑當中是否牽涉無縫接軌。</p>\n<h2>區顯揚發文暗示遭背叛引爆派帽疑雲</h2>\n<p>排球員區顯揚無預警於社交網站發布限時動態，內容疑似暗指自己慘遭譚旻萱背叛。帖文內弦外之音引起廣泛討論，讓這場風波衍生出另一受害者，迅速躍升為網上熱門話題。雖然雙方暫未對緋聞作出正式官方聲明，但牽涉多位體壇健將與星二代複雜關係，已經驅使大批粉絲湧入當事人社交帳號尋找蛛絲馬跡。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳康堤 黃澤林 陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294196506533005_5251584346ade1f8d7acfa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179294196506533005_5251584346ade1f8d7acfa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>網民猜測即係兩個都無縫接軌？（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 康堤 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"qST3rKvF3piR_LJMvrvo51T3KOHYsOcWZgYKR2YGCkc.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179307130678418468_13062066686ae018cb37089.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Mandy與身兼排球教練及餐廳老闆區顯揚低調相戀（圖片來源：IG@austinauhinyeung）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:18.975352+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1403,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:03:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:58:44.990975+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:36.164715+00:00","content_hash":"7455baf8f1a9e4db3fea218a8e9a14405e522bb1db05aa9e40d627483d340e01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}